From: x <x@y.z>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 23:10:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] simplefb: discover device tree simple-framebuffer nodes

Parse the first enabled simple-framebuffer child of /chosen, resolving the
base through memory-region (falling back to reg), converting the DT's byte
stride to the pixel stride used by FRAMEBUFFER_STRIDE, and rejecting
formats other than a8r8g8b8/x8r8g8b8, short strides, undersized regions
and unaligned bases. Host tests build FDTs in-process; an optional test
checks a DTB compiled from Linux sdm845-oneplus-enchilada.dts.

Co-Authored-By: Cursor <noreply@cursor.com>
